            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"80ee0058-7a68-4ca9-84c0-79334ce70dde\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>Welcome! In this lesson, you’ll create your first program with Python and see it come to life.</p></body></html>"
